{"id":"vod_sn_37195","vodId":"37195","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"无口的森田小姐第二季","name_cn":"无口的森田小姐第二季","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b5e60be172f7db41fad84391882d26f7.jpg"},"summary":"主角女高中生森田真由，这位总是沉默寡言的无口少女的校园及日常生活。森田之所以总是不说话，并不是因为她讨厌说话或真的没话可说，而是因为常常在说话前会思考大量的事情，所以总是弄得错过了和别人一起交谈的时机。也因为这种错过，所以经常弄出笑话来。 森田真由，其实她也并不是天生少言，而是因为“话还没整理好”、“时机不对”、“比较擅长倾听别人说话”又或者是“想太多”而变得少言。再加上母亲的教导下她习惯盯着对方的眼睛看，因此也招来了不少误会。byyakubd.cc","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:50","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p99rLCz4R11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WEV7XGpBZH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C7WfvyYJBa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CAjbJ4BLfg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e0cxws31hm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K2PY7Pmj8r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5Y9itKATmv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8pxWP4ZWzN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xDa7x3M3fY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z8Cm2LVFwC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y8G1Wu2uhF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G9s8PBVZ1s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nJNDGh4bQ61/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:13.648Z"}